  aciklama:
  - "Senin i\xE7in yakt\u0131\u011F\u0131m ate\u015Fin alevi kan k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131
    {{isim}}. Ayr\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131na \xE7ok mu \xFCz\xFCld\xFCn acaba? \u0130\u015F
    hayat\u0131nda her \u015Fey g\xFCzel giderken, bir t\xFCrl\xFC ayn\u0131 \u015Fans\u0131
    a\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda da yakalayamam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Bu alev, i\u015Fin
    i\xE7inde tutku oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Bu tutku sizi {{zaman}} alaca\u011F\u0131n
    bir mesajla birlikte yeniden bir araya getirebilir."
